# Teletext Navigator: build outputs and local files that never belong in
# the repository. Named explicitly rather than "*.exe": the GW-BASIC
# interpreter firmware/gwbasic/GWBASICA.EXE is source the build embeds and
# must stay tracked.
*.o
*.obj
*.res
*.wixpdb
*.log
*.bak*
*~
/TeletextNavigator.exe
/TeletextNavigator.exe.*
/tools/*.exe
/installer/out/
/installer/payload-navigator/
/installer/art-navigator/
/web/minitel/dist/
tools/__pycache__/

# Flash in the Retro Web Browser tab (docs/2026-11-05_RETROWEB_RUFFLE.md):
# the DLL is a build output; third_party/ruffle/vendor/ must stay WHOLE
# (every crate lists all its files in .cargo-checksum.json, and some are
# a .o, a .log or a .dll that the patterns above would drop). Keep LAST.
/nav_ruffle.dll
/third_party/ruffle/target/
!/third_party/ruffle/vendor/**
